# Performance Kuralları

Önce oku: `SUCCESS_METRICS.md`, `BACKEND_ARCHITECTURE.md`, `FRONTEND_ARCHITECTURE.md`, `SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md`

## Backend targets

Auth <100ms, Feed <150ms, Search <200ms, Game detail <120ms, Notifications <80ms, Messages <100ms

## Frontend targets

Launch <2s, Feed load <1s, Navigation <300ms, Game detail <500ms, Search <300ms

## Infrastructure

- Uptime 99.95%; horizontal scaling, Redis cache, CDN, read replicas
- Analytics never block user requests (async queue)

## API (SUCCESS_METRICS alignment)

API <200ms avg, Feed API <500ms, Search <150ms, Messaging <200ms, CDN <300ms, crash-free 99.8%

## Caching (`CACHE_STRATEGY.md`)

- Pattern: Cache Aside; Redis 8; keys `domain:resource:id`
- TTL örnekleri: feed 60s, trending 30s, game detail 24h, search suggestions 1h
- Write: DB commit → invalidate → background refresh (never cache before commit)
- Redis down → fallback PostgreSQL; cache is not source of truth
- Never cache: passwords, JWT secrets, OAuth secrets, payment data
- Targets: lookup <5ms, hit ratio >90%
